WEBVTT

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:02.410
There will be wars and rumors of wars.

00:00:03.890 --> 00:00:10.937
Look at the world situation: Iran's war
with Israel and the United States, and the

00:00:10.937 --> 00:00:12.570
Russia-Ukraine war.

00:00:12.570 --> 00:00:15.810
There are also more than twenty other wars
being fought.

00:00:16.350 --> 00:00:25.463
And rumors of war around the Taiwan
Strait, the South and East China Seas, and
many

00:00:25.463 --> 00:00:26.890
other places.

00:00:26.890 --> 00:00:31.350
There is unrest of every kind.

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:37.262
Nation rising against nation means civil
war; kingdom against kingdom means

00:00:37.262 --> 00:00:40.730
international war. We see these in the
news.

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:47.360
Third, earthquakes. I will show you a
chart later.

00:00:48.900 --> 00:00:54.500
Earthquakes are becoming more frequent and
occurring closer together.

00:00:54.500 --> 00:00:58.660
It is like a woman's contractions before
childbirth.

00:00:59.280 --> 00:01:06.980
The Bible uses the image of birth pangs.
This too is a clear prophecy.

00:01:08.560 --> 00:01:12.300
Fourth, there will be famines and
pestilences in various places.

00:01:13.480 --> 00:01:21.240
Of the world's eight billion people,
nearly a billion face serious hunger.

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:27.880
Especially with the Russia-Ukraine war and
the war in the Middle East,

00:01:28.540 --> 00:01:34.000
Oil supplies cannot get through, leading
to shortages of chemical fertilizers.

00:01:34.000 --> 00:01:39.040
This will lead to severe famine in the
coming years.

00:01:40.640 --> 00:01:50.246
The global COVID pandemic lasted about
three years. It too is an important
reminder

00:01:50.246 --> 00:01:50.940
to us.

00:01:51.620 --> 00:02:00.700
Recently there was also an outbreak on a
cruise ship, causing widespread alarm.

00:02:01.420 --> 00:02:06.840
These two issues are connected, and both
are closely related to climate change.

00:02:07.380 --> 00:02:16.152
As climate change worsens, agricultural
production, rainfall, and other conditions

00:02:16.152 --> 00:02:19.040
are being greatly affected.

00:02:21.130 --> 00:02:22.570
There will be terrors.

00:02:25.410 --> 00:02:31.610
When I read this in the last century, such
terrors seemed far away.

00:02:32.750 --> 00:02:38.430
Back then, we associated terrorism with
Palestinian groups hijacking aircraft.

00:02:38.930 --> 00:02:43.908
But at the start of the twenty-first
century, the two World Trade Center towers
were

00:02:43.908 --> 00:02:45.390
attacked on September 11.

00:02:46.010 --> 00:02:49.830
Since then, terrorists have been willing
to give up their own lives.

00:02:50.370 --> 00:02:58.310
Now air travel and other settings face
terrifying incidents in many places.

00:02:58.310 --> 00:03:04.290
It has become so common that we hardly pay
attention anymore.

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:07.310
Yet these things will become more serious.
